ntID":"1536051001","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"不知不觉间，你又来到了这张雅库伯尔人为“狩猎神”精心准...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:1:1536051002:1":{"key":"say:1:1536051002:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"1","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1536051002","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"它依然整洁、柔软，没有沾染一丝灰尘，似乎一直有人细心打...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:2:1536051003:0":{"key":"say:2:1536051003:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"2","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1536051003","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"与此同时，你注意到了床边那个小小的玩偶——<style...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:3:1536051004:0":{"key":"say:3:1536051004:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"3","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1536051004","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"而它的旁边，还摆放着几乎堆成一座小山的卷轴。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"document:4:485:0":{"key":"document:4:485:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>大人：\n今天是您离开的第五十天，雅库伯尔正逐渐从神堕和战争的黑暗中走出，梅林和摩根帮了我们不少忙，我的魔法也有了一些长进，只是，不知道什么时候才能追赶上您……\n狩猎神奥法迦陨落之后，戈丹原本想命人撤去这张为神准备的床铺，但我坚持把它留了下来。这是属于您的休息之处！除非您下令，否则我不会让任何人改变这里，就算是少一株花也不行！\n我做了两个玩偶，一个是您，一个是我。每次看到它们待在一起，我都感觉……好像您就在我身边一样。\n真希望，与您重逢的那一天能早点到来呀。\n…………………………\n<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>大人：\n今天是您离开的第七十三天。\n我的魔法越来越厉害了，梅林和摩根都说，只要继续坚持下去，我很快就能独当一面了。可是我觉得，和您比起来，我还差得很远很远。\n不知道什么时候，我才能开始学习时空魔法呢？凭借着神明陨落之后的力量，我应该就能再次见到您吧……\n虽然和一万年相比，您离开的时间才如此短暂，但我已经非常非常想念您了……\n希望您在未来……一切安好。\n…………………………\n<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>大人：\n我要离开雅库伯尔一阵子了。\n梅林说，世上的许多神都出现了神堕的迹象，为了防止他们危害世界，必须尽快消灭他们。不过丰饶神还没有陨落，所以梅林决定让摩根留下来，由她带着我去清除其他神明。\n我向您保证：为了守护被您拯救的雅库伯尔、守护您所爱的这个世界，我一定会竭尽全力。\n远行之前，希望您能允许我带上这个按照您模样制作的玩偶。有它在我身边，仿佛您也在遥远的未来支持着我。\n至于另一个“加拉玩偶”，就让它留在主树厅，留在您休息的地方，替我等待您的归来……","textdes_id":"485","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"509200233","document_item_id":"0","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item4_22.png","document_image_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item4_22.png","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item4_22.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"true"},"say:5:1536051005:1":{"key":"say:5:1536051005:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1536051005","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"卷轴上满是加拉小巧的字迹，字里行间无不透露着对你的思念。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1536051006:1":{"key":"say:6:1536051006:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1536051006","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"“加拉玩偶”一动不动地趴在床边，用温和而充满崇拜的目光...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1536051007:0":{"key":"say:7:1536051007:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1536051007","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你无法否认自己的内心：尽管你和加拉分离的时间不算太久，...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1536051008:0":{"key":"say:8:1536051008:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1536051008","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"如果加拉可以将你的玩偶带在身边，那你为什么不能把“加拉...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""}},"speaker_entries":{"speaker:旁白":{"key":"speaker:旁白","source":"旁白"}},"stats":{"source_node_count":10,"graph_node_count":10,"effect_event_count":0,"text_entry_count":9,"speaker_entry_count":1,"cast_state_line_count":8,"path_dependent_cast_state_count":0,"cinematic_count":0,"picture_count":0,"subtitle_count":0,"cinematic_dialogue_count":0}}